's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#ja%C3%ABl-set)\n- [Sharnies's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#sharnies-set)\n- [Joe Kay's Second Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#joe-kays-second-set)\n- [Shaka Lion's Set](/episodes/all-day-2019/#shaka-lions-set)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":29100,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-01-01T16:21:36+00:00"},"title":"Shaka Lion's Set","position":4}},{"id":"B-HcjDuu6aU","position":28,"timestamp":"00:58:26","rawTrack":"Flako - Honey Drips","track":{"id":"MzEjipb87tU","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips/","slug":"honey-drips","title":"Honey Drips","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ec8ofpRBzes","slug":"518","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-518/ra.1581012784","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-518-golden-era-of-soundcloud-2008-2017-pt-2"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #518 (Golden Era of SoundCloud: 2008-2017 Pt. II)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-518.jpg","content":"Vol. 2 - Joe goes through the classic beat era of 2008-2017.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-08-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"KHMPJElcy4A","position":28,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Lonely Town feat. Dirg Gerner","track":{"id":"gNFTo6GyK10","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner/","slug":"lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner","title":"Lonely Town feat. Dirg Gerner","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mSPdtWhFWZA","slug":"134","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-134-w-penthouse-penthouse-colta/"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #134 w/ Penthouse Penthouse & Colta","artwork":"/images/episodes/134.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-06-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"o1fAruiTrAY","position":54,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Eclosure","track":{"id":"o_3IRhF3Neo","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure/","slug":"eclosure","title":"Eclosure","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"T_dx3o5-Kh4","position":27,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Honey Drips","track":{"id":"MzEjipb87tU","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips/","slug":"honey-drips","title":"Honey Drips","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"lvLR-jIK1BU","slug":"145","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-145"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #145","artwork":"/images/episodes/145.jpg","content":"\nJoe selects 60 minutes of energy from Soulection HQ\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3662,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"q1YSw84SMwA","position":86,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Mating Dance","track":{"id":"hr5Ytb5FNKs","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/mating-dance/","slug":"mating-dance","title":"Mating Dance","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/mating-dance.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"rlZ9L0LRpHc","position":16,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - I Need You","track":{"id":"gYi7lJqtlVA","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/i-need-you/","slug":"i-need-you","title":"I Need You","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/i-need-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"0epFtTHFxzk","position":54,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Honey Drips","track":{"id":"MzEjipb87tU","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips/","slug":"honey-drips","title":"Honey Drips","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"zWfOz1wZlqE","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Eclosure","track":{"id":"o_3IRhF3Neo","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure/","slug":"eclosure","title":"Eclosure","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"z5JoNMlnx-A","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Eclosure","track":{"id":"o_3IRhF3Neo","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure/","slug":"eclosure","title":"Eclosure","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"d0k9XnyM3Ok","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Eclosure","track":{"id":"o_3IRhF3Neo","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure/","slug":"eclosure","title":"Eclosure","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"lL6rMc2InNU","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Lonely Town feat. Dirg Gerner","track":{"id":"gNFTo6GyK10","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner/","slug":"lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner","title":"Lonely Town feat. Dirg Gerner","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"brFh4QBhAJE","slug":"167","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-167"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #167","artwork":"/images/episodes/167.jpg","content":"Take a deep breath and slow things down with Joe Kay\n<!--more-->\n\nSo many good things have been going on in our world but sometimes it is overwhelming. However we just take a deep breath and keep it moving. This week Joe Kay wanted to slow things down a bit and just focus on the music by going solo. Joe started off with some nice neo-soul/Dilla-esque vibes and then progressed into some progressive beats to get your energy flowing. Standout artists to look out for are LOSCO. These guys have a heavy, heavy sound. Just wait til you hear. As the show progressed the engagement via social media was massive and a few people randomly requested to hear a Sango tribute so we did one! Joe dropped a 42 minute set of primarily unreleased music to keep things interesting! We hope you enjoy the show and feel free to spread it to as many people as possible. Real radio is here.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10845,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":2}},{"id":"rE9UFC5pflg","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Honey Drips","track":{"id":"MzEjipb87tU","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips/","slug":"honey-drips","title":"Honey Drips","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/honey-drips.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-172-w-rhettmatic-beat-junkies"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10880,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"BXS74nehidQ","position":53,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Eclosure","track":{"id":"o_3IRhF3Neo","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure/","slug":"eclosure","title":"Eclosure","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-176-rinse-fm-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #176 (RINSE FM Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/176.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10778,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"DJx94WQzgro","position":36,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - 05 Fresh Air","track":{"id":"6XnVrmqQLS8","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/fresh-air/","slug":"fresh-air","title":"Fresh Air","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/fresh-air.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dmevNeYyuRE","slug":"179","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-179"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #179","artwork":"/images/episodes/179.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"tngmtJPHaW0","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - The Answer feat. Dirg Gerner","track":{"id":"vM5xqt-ZRvc","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/the-answer-feat-dirg-gerner/","slug":"the-answer-feat-dirg-gerner","title":"The Answer feat. Dirg Gerner","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/the-answer-feat-dirg-gerner.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"M2wkPVc9GEQ","slug":"188","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-188-w-lakim"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #188 w/ LAKIM","artwork":"/images/episodes/188.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10620,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-11T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"5y2UiFg9kkg","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Eclosure","track":{"id":"o_3IRhF3Neo","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure/","slug":"eclosure","title":"Eclosure","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/eclosure.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"M2wkPVc9GEQ","slug":"188","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-188-w-lakim"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #188 w/ LAKIM","artwork":"/images/episodes/188.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10620,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-11T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"9OhdGdtUTCA","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Mating Dance","track":{"id":"hr5Ytb5FNKs","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/mating-dance/","slug":"mating-dance","title":"Mating Dance","artist":{"slug":"flako","title":"fLako"},"artwork":"images/artists/flako/tracks/mating-dance.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays's Session","position":1}},{"id":"2Mv_h8fl9p8","position":52,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"fLako - Lonely Town feat. Dirg Gerner","track":{"id":"gNFTo6GyK10","path":"/artists/flako/tracks/lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner/","slug":"lonely-town-feat-dirg-gerner","title":"Lonely Town feat. Dirg Gerner","artist":{"slu